== Effects ==
* Attaches a ball and chain to Isaac's ankle that blocks projectiles and deals 5 damage per tick (~10.7 damage per second).
* If the ball is moving fast enough, it will destroy any destructible [[Obstacles]] it comes into contact with.

== Notes ==
* Despite its appearance, the item does not slow Isaac's movement.
* Cannot be used to open {{R|Secret Room}}s or {{R|Super Secret Room}}s.
* Can be used to initiate the Uriel/Gabriel fight inside Angel Rooms.

== Synergies ==
* [[Flight]]: Any method of flight makes it easier and quicker to use Samson's Chains to smash rocks, making for an efficient way to search for {{R|Crawl Space}}s.
* {{c|Tainted Forgotten}}: The ball is chained to the Forgotten, giving throws additional damage and obstacle destruction. While the Forgotten is held by the Soul, the ball may be swung around as normal.

